---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const locale = 'en';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" locale={locale} description="Privacy Policy of CellPowerX Wellness Center - how we collect, use and protect your personal data under GDPR.">

  <section class="page-hero section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="reveal">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content reveal">

        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how CellPowerX Wellness Center collects, uses and protects the personal data of its website users and clients, in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>

        <h2>2. Data Controller</h2>
        <p>CellPowerX Wellness Center</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:geral@int-medicine.com">geral@int-medicine.com</a></p>

        <h2>3. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following personal data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name</li>
          <li>Email</li>
          <li>Phone number</li>
          <li>Information you provide in contact or booking forms (please do not include health information in these forms)</li>
          <li>Browsing data (cookies, IP address, use of the website)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Purposes</h2>
        <p>We use your data to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Reply to contact requests</li>
          <li>Manage bookings</li>
          <li>Provide our wellness services</li>
          <li>Send communications (when you have agreed)</li>
          <li>Improve the website experience</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Legal Basis</h2>
        <p>We process your data on the basis of:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your consent</li>
          <li>Performance of a service you requested</li>
          <li>Compliance with legal obligations</li>
          <li>Legitimate interest</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We never sell your data. We use the following service providers (processors), who handle data only on our behalf:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Cloudflare - website hosting, form processing and aggregated visit statistics</li>
          <li>Brevo - email delivery and newsletter management</li>
          <li>GoDaddy - email service</li>
          <li>Google - location map, only if you accept it</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Data may also be disclosed to authorities when required by law.</p>

        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We keep data only for as long as needed for the purposes for which it was collected.</p>

        <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access your personal data</li>
          <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Have your data erased</li>
          <li>Restrict processing</li>
          <li>Object to processing</li>
          <li>Data portability</li>
          <li>Withdraw your consent at any time, without affecting processing already carried out</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:geral@int-medicine.com">geral@int-medicine.com</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Portuguese Data Protection Authority, CNPD (<a href="https://www.cnpd.pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.cnpd.pt</a>).</p>

        <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
        <p>By default, the website only uses storage that is strictly necessary for it to work, including a record of your cookie choices. Third-party content, such as the Google map, only loads if you consent. You can change your choices at any time through the "Cookie Preferences" link in the footer.</p>
        <p>To count visits in aggregate we use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or store data that identifies visitors.</p>

        <h2>10. Security</h2>
        <p>We apply appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data against unauthorised access, loss or destruction.</p>

        <h2>11. Changes</h2>
        <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. We recommend checking this page regularly.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding-top: calc(72px + var(--section-spacing));
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.3125rem);
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--wc-charcoal);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
